Source: pve-cloudinit-extras
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Pierre Kisters <pierrekisters@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: pve-cloudinit-extras
Architecture: all
Depends: pve-manager (>= 9.2), pve-manager (<< 10), libtemplate-perl, ${misc:Depends}
Description: cicustom and include fields for the Proxmox VE Cloud-Init tab
 Adds "Custom files" (cicustom) and "Include" (snippet or URL via vendor-data)
 rows to the VM Cloud-Init panel. Loads a separate JS file through one marker
 line in index.html.tpl, re-applied by a dpkg trigger after pve-manager
 upgrades and removed exactly on uninstall.

Package: pve-cloudinit-extras-api
Architecture: all
Depends: pve-cloudinit-extras (= ${binary:Version}), pve-manager (>= 9.2), pve-manager (<< 9.3), ${misc:Depends}
Description: snippet-writer API for pve-cloudinit-extras
 Adds /nodes/{node}/cloudinit-extras, which writes a fixed-name "#include <url>"
 snippet per VM. Requires VM.Config.Cloudinit and Datastore.AllocateSpace.
 Registers itself via two marker lines in PVE/API2/Nodes.pm.
